    "text": "President Donald Trump attended the dignified transfer of two National Guardsmen and an interpreter killed in Syria. Trump met with the families of the fallen at Dover Air Force Base in Delaware before the solemn event. To help understand the significance of this event, NTD spoke to Mike Sarraille, U.S. Navy SEAL veteran and chief talent officer at Overwatch Mission Critical.\nTrump Fulfilling Solemn Covenant in Attending Dignified Transfer of Fallen National Guardsmen: Former SEAL\nMike Sarraille, U.S. Navy SEAL veteran, discussed President Donald Trump attending the dignified transfer of National Guardsmen and an interpreter killed in Syria.\n|\nPublished: 12/17/2025, 11:59:28 PM EST",
